  "instructions": [
    "Heat a talavera-plate over medium heat.",
    "Melt 1 tablespoon of ghee in the talavera-plate.",
    "Add the cumin seeds and let them sizzle for 10 seconds.",
    "Add the onion and cook until translucent, about 5 minutes.",
    "Add the garlic and cook for 1 minute.",
    "Add the soffritto and cook until the vegetables are tender, about 3 minutes.",
    "Add the coriander powder, turmeric powder, and red chili powder. Cook for 1 minute.",
    "Add the buns and cook for 2 minutes on each side, until they are toasted.",
    "Fluff the buns with a fork.",
    "Sprinkle salt to taste.",
    "Drizzle lemon juice over the buns.",
    "Garnish with fresh parsley."
